efinition-resolution\",\"active-composition-compile\",\"layout-width-compatibility\",\"plugin-child-slot-contract\"],\"commit\":\"all-or-nothing\",\"postCommitVerificationRequired\":true,\"guidance\":\"Use this snapshot to form the semantic delta. Do not preflight facts covered by these admission checks with manifest, source, CSS, Service, or generated-file reads. Admission success commits static AppUIModel state only; post-commit verification is still required against the current revision.\"},\"runtimeObservation\":{\"tool\":\"inspect_runtime_layout\",\"toolGroup\":\"debugging\",\"enableIfNeeded\":{\"tool\":\"enable_creator_tools\",\"input\":{\"groups\":[\"debugging\"]}},\"input\":{\"nodeRefs\":[\"l0\"]},\"useWhen\":\"Actual dimensions, wrapping, container structure or mode-attribute locations are needed. Use the live observation instead of tracing framework/npm implementations to guess rendered DOM.\",\"coverage\":\"Fresh rectangles, bounded semantic-region structure, attribute locations and computed layout styles. No text, input values, arbitrary selectors or JavaScript.\",\"evidenceBoundary\":\"Tool availability is not proof that the preview is connected or the goal is satisfied. Explicit geometry outcomes need fresh relevant rectangles before completion; a static pass alone is insufficient. Enable a tool group alone before using its tools.\"},\"projection\":{\"kind\":\"navigation_summary\",\"omitted\":[\"repeated Plugin authoring descriptions/intents\",\"action labels/descriptions\",\"duplicate capability instance placement\"],\"fullResult\":{\"tool\":\"inspect_ui_project\",\"input\":{\"view\":\"composition\",\"detail\":\"full\"}},\"pluginDetails\":\"inspect_ui_plugin returns the selected Plugin's full API, composition and ownership\"}}}","role":"tool"}

