data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_01_c6lnGxXKFo0oSIs9fV6U0090","messageId":"0af2af1b-d7fe-438f-80ca-46776ca1b131","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"373e8784ed400aa3d4982d94a83cffc45fb4fede729b539cc5b62ef39947bfd9\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/custom-ag-ui-events\",\"title\":\"4. 注册并启用插件\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/custom-ag-ui-events.md\",\"summary\":\"按步骤将自定义 CUSTOM 事件解析并显示为消息卡片。\",\"sha256\":\"29f23a159ddd3b0f79b1b0668e0270d52473e07b81a5196504ef6a85adfe708b\",\"sectionId\":\"s111\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":943,\"content\":\"## 4. 注册并启用插件\\n\\n新建 `plugins/ticket-summary-message/manifest.json`：\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"ticket-summary-message\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Ticket summary message\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Displays ticket summaries.\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.0.1\\\",\\n  \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"headless\\\"],\\n  \\\"data\\\": { \\\"messageUI\\\": true }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n新建同目录的 `definition.ts`：\\n\\n```ts\\nimport {\\n  parseUIPluginManifest,\\n  type UIPluginDefinition,\\n} from '@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/contracts';\\nimport { ticketSummaryUI } from './index';\\nimport manifest from './manifest.json';\\n\\nconst definition: UIPluginDefinition = {\\n  manifest: parseUIPluginManifest(manifest),\\n  dataMessageUIs: [ticketSummaryUI],\\n  Component: () => null,\\n};\\n\\nexport default definition;\\n```\\n\\n在 AppUIModel 已有的 `applicationPlugins` 数组中追加：\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"pluginId\\\": \\\"ticket-summary-message\\\",\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"ticket-summary-message-main\\\",\\n  \\\"enabled\\\": true\\n}\\n```\\n\\n按[注册步骤](/development/create-plugin.md#4-更新注册并检查)更新插件注册表，也可以让 Creator 完成注册。每个消息名只启用一个渲染器。\\n\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

